Order: the pin is committed, then this record is anchored, then the disk image is opened. The known holes are measured as they are. The counting rules fix hits, false alarms, denominators, Wilson 95% intervals and the merging of cells under 20 items before any answer is seen.

**The SHA-256 of this document is anchored to the JIDEC ledger and stamped to Bitcoin. After anchoring, this record cannot be altered. Corrections are later entries that cite this one.**
